codex
The first visual pass is clean: the lighting no longer overlaps controls, the overview now reads in clear operational layers, class mode is comfortable at 1024, and turma’s cooperative hero dominates the page as intended. The 390 layout has no horizontal overflow and preserves 44px controls. I’m now reviewing the lower-frequency tools—student detail, attendance, export, goal, and admin roles—and exercising the opt-in state so the “top three plus you” variant is verified as well as the default-private state.
