codex
The secondary tools also hold up at both widths. I found and fixed two smaller issues during that review: coach attendance was using UTC instead of the app’s New York calendar day, and the player-note field was squeezed by the XP form’s grid. The leaderboard now treats any missing consent value as private—not merely an explicit `false`—and stale cached boards are recomputed before the new streak board is shown. Next I’m producing the complete final screenshot set, including a 1024 class-mode tablet and a below-podium “you” case.
