The full screenshot set is now written for all nine scoped screens at 1440 and 390, plus class mode at 1024 and extra private/opted-in turma states. The automated capture confirmed the default checkbox is off, a fourth-place player sees exactly the top three plus their own row, and every captured width has zero horizontal overflow. The only browser console item was Chromium’s own unsupported `compute-pressure` permissions-policy notice; there were no application errors. I’m running the mandated smoke flow now, then I’ll do the final diff/report/commit pass.
